                                         rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialOfComposition> ;
                                         rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialType> ;
                                         rdfs:comment "Links material to its type in some classification system used by the sector."@en ;
                                         rdfs:label "has material type"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasMeasurementUnit
