                              rdfs:label "item"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#manufacturer
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#manufacturer> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <https://w3id.org/eudpp#EconomicOperatorRole> ;
